    For example:
    logical plan tree:
    ```
                    project
                       |
                     filter(a>0)
                       |
                     filter(b>0)
                       |
                     scan
    ```
    transformed to:
    ```
                     project
                        |
                     filter(a>0 and b>0)
                        |
                      scan
    ```

