    ```
            +-- ---- ---- ---+- ---- ---- ---- ---+- ---- ----- ---- ----TreeNode-----------------+
            |                |                    |                                               |
                                                                                                  |
            |                |                    |                                               |
                                                                                                  v
            v                v                    v                                           Abstract Tree Node
        Leaf Node        Unary Node          Binary Node                              +--------          ---------+
            |                |                    |                                   |        (children)         |
                                                                                      |                           |
            v                v                    v                                   v                           v
    Leaf Expression   Unary Expression      Binary Expression              +------Expression----+           Plan Node
            |                |                    |                        |                    |
                                                                           |                    |
            |                |                    |                        v                    v
            |                |                    +- ---- ---- -----> Comparison Predicate     Named Expr
                                                                                           +----   -------+
            |                |                                                             v              v
            |                +- -- --- --- --- --- --- --- --- --- --- --- --- --- ---> Alias Expr      Slot
                                                                                                          ^
            |                                                                                             |
            |                                                                                             |
            +---- --- ---- ------ ---- ------- ------ ------- --- ------ ------ ----- ---- ----- ----- ---+
    ```

