Date:   Thu May 27 22:05:41 2021 +0800

    [BUG] Fix in memory table may cause a lot of CPU consumption when LRU Cache evict (#5908)
    
    According to the LRU priority, the `lru list` is split into `lru normal list` and `lru durable list`,
